### ============================================================================
### File: docs/api-tests/00-health-auth.http
### Purpose: API test requests for Module 0 (Health & Foundation)
### Compatible with: VS Code REST Client and Thunder Client
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### [Health Probe] Check System & Database Health
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name healthCheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### [404 Error Envelope] Access Non-Existent Route
### Expect: 404 Not Found with standard { success: false, error: { code, message } }
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name nonExistentRoute
GET {{baseUrl}}/non-existent-endpoint
Accept: application/json
